  "body": "Property File: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/PFS6\r\n\r\nRarely does a property combine space, premium finishes, and coastal appeal so effortlessly. \r\n\r\nJust three years young, this impressive 448sqm legal home and income residence sits on a generous 650sqm freehold site in a peaceful Murrays Bay cul-de-sac. Offering beautiful East Coast Bays sea views, it presents a rare opportunity to secure a substantial family home with independent accommodation and income potential. \r\n\r\nA striking 6-meter-high entrance void and 3.3-meter ceilings in the main living areas create an exceptional sense of light and volume. The open-plan heart of the home features a gas fireplace and a beautifully appointed kitchen with Miele appliances and a statement 3-meter waterfall-edge island. Expansive glazing and multiple decks seamlessly connect the indoors with the stunning coastal outlook. \r\n\r\nThe main residence offers four bedrooms, a dedicated study(or fifth bedroom), and three versatile living areas, including a rumpus room. Adding incredible flexibility is the separate, legal two-bedroom dwelling with its own living space-perfect for generating rental income, housing extended family, or providing independence for adult children. \r\n\r\nOutside, the fully fenced, landscaped grounds provide a safe and inviting haven for children, pets, and outdoor entertaining. The location is unbeatable: tucked away quietly, yet within walking distance of Murrays Bay Primary School, Murrays Bay Intermediate, and Rangitoto College. Local beaches, cafés, and everyday amenities are just moments away. \r\n\r\nWith our overseas-bound owners committed to selling, do not miss this chance to secure the space, lifestyle, and income potential your family deserves.\r\n\r\n*Conjunctions from all Agents welcome*",
